  "story": {
    "text": "At school, everyone trades pickled {LIMES}, and Amy has a whole bag. But Mr. Davis has {BANNED} them. He makes her throw them out of the {WINDOW}, and strikes her hand with a {RULER}. Amy bears it without {FLINCHING}, and never goes back, burning with {SHAME}.",
